# Per-board repo overrides for rpi5-nvme (blacksail tree).
#
# RPi5 (NVMe) on the blacksail OE series (fleet unification with the Jetsons).
# See docs/plans/wendyos-update-rpi.md and the rpi5-blacksail feasibility note.
#
# WENDYOS_LAYER_TREE="blacksail" makes bootstrap clone every upstream repo under
# repos/blacksail/. No SRCREV override: the pins come from the shared blacksail
# set in scripts/upstream-repos.env, which makes this board identical to rpi5-sd.
# Only STORAGE/MACHINE differ (local.conf). The meta-tegra* pins in that set are
# irrelevant here — RPi never layers them.
WENDYOS_LAYER_TREE="blacksail"

# NOTE: rpi5 builds oe-core's stock U-Boot (v2026.07 at the current pin), so it
# moves with SRCREV_OECORE. meta-rpi-extensions/recipes-bsp/u-boot/
# u-boot_%.bbappend only adds the Pi 5 config fragments and, on the NVMe
# machine, the phys->bus DMA patch. Re-test Pi 5 boot when a pin bump moves
# U-Boot.
#
# No REPOS_EXTRA: blacksail oe-core ships Go and U-Boot 2026.07 natively, so
# nothing has to be backported.
